    doc_level,
    doc_pager,
    sidebar,
    init_docs_sidebar

[$in title:["Choices"]]
[$in description:["Choice declarations, variants, payload patterns and structural equality in Moth."]]
[$in head:[language_theme_head]]

[navbar]
[sidebar]
init_docs_sidebar()!
[section, $md:
    # Choices

    A choice creates a nominal tagged union. Each value carries one named variant
    with an optional record payload, much like an enum with data in Rust.

    Pattern matching opens payloads without nullable fields or unchecked casts.
    Equality remains available only when every possible payload type supports it.
]

